      "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "▶  STEP 1:  max f₀ − πₖλₖDₖ − (ρ/2)‖Dₖ−Dₖⁿ‖²\n→ Devuelve:  Dₖⁿ⁺¹, ηⁿ⁺¹, C_maxⁿ⁺¹",
