    {
      "id": "text_admm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1668, "y": 438,
      "width": 254, "height": 344,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#7b2fa8", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "seed": 24,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 24, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "ADMM LOOP\n(Boyd §7.3.2)\n──────────────\nSTEP 1\nAgregador\n↓\nDₖⁿ⁺¹, ηⁿ⁺¹\n\nSTEP 2\nN FSPs ‖ (pool)\n↓\nFᵢₖⁿ⁺¹  ∀i\n\nSTEP 3\nSₖ = Σᵢ Fᵢₖ\nrₚ = Dₖ − Sₖ\nλⁿ⁺¹ = λⁿ+(ρ/J)rₚ\nAdapta ρ\n──────────────\n‖rₚ‖<εₚ ∧ ‖rᵈ‖<εᵈ\n→ Convergido",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 11, "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ADMM LOOP\n(Boyd §7.3.2)\n──────────────\nSTEP 1\nAgregador\n↓\nDₖⁿ⁺¹, ηⁿ⁺¹\n\nSTEP 2\nN FSPs ‖ (pool)\n↓\nFᵢₖⁿ⁺¹  ∀i\n\nSTEP 3\nSₖ = Σᵢ Fᵢₖ\nrₚ = Dₖ − Sₖ\nλⁿ⁺¹ = λⁿ+(ρ/J)rₚ\nAdapta ρ\n──────────────\n‖rₚ‖<εₚ ∧ ‖rᵈ‖<εᵈ\n→ Convergido"
    },

    {
