      "text": "CLEARING EXPLÍCITO:  Σᵢ F_{i,k} = D_k  ∀k ∈ K  :  λ_k\nResidual primal:  rₚ = Dₖ − Sₖ  →  0   (equilibrio Walrasiano)",
